# modern_prng mod (input.sav carries RTST record 17 with the mod bit and record 13 with the
# stream for seed 1234): the same three Lost City Rumours as map_rumour_colonist_outcomes, rolled
# from the xoshiro256** stream instead of the DOS LCG (state 2293), so all three come out different.
key KP_6                   # Scout east onto (30,62): "nothing but rumors" (LCG: small treasure 300)
wait 3
key Return
wait 2
key s                      # sentry the Scout: Preacher #131 is selected
wait 2
key KP_6                   # east onto (39,22): small friendly tribe's gift, gold 429 -> 467 (LCG: @LOSTCITY5 despawn)
wait 3
key Return                 # colonist #134 is selected
wait 2
key KP_4                   # west onto (36,25): "nothing but rumors" (LCG: Cibola)
wait 3
key Return
wait 2
